{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/16/2504317/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"HELLO"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/16/2504317/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/16/2504317/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーみんなとお寿司屋さんに食べに行ったの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/16/2504317/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/16/2504317/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなたくさん食べるんだけどドンドンみんなお腹いっぱいなって帰って行っちゃうの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやとまりかとみりあが最後の最後まで残ってお寿司たくさん食べてるんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやとまりかのお寿司は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シャリの上にネタが5枚ぐらい乗ってたりして‥それを永遠食べてて"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/16/2504317/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食べたね〜って言いながら端っこの方見たら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりんが..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お店って各席にガリが置いてあるじゃない？そのガリの箱沢山並べてガリだけ食べてて‥"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まっちゅんどしたのー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って聞いたら まっちゅんが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「今野さんに松村は食べすぎるから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お寿司食べるなって言われたからずっとガリ食べてんねん」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言ってた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな夢を見ました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/16/2504317/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/16/2504317/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/16/2504317/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/16/2504317/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/16/2504317/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてこの前はおみやげでラーメンを貰ったから、お父さんがラーメン好きだから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"喜ぶかなぁって思って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おみあげで持って帰ってあげようと思って大事にカバン入れてたから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみちゃんがね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「えいっ！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってラーメンの面になる部分！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのパリパリのところを手で潰してきて‥"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「やめてよー」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言ったら「ごめんごめん」って笑ってたの...涙"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから夢の場面が変わって、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやがかずみんと話してたら、また あみちゃんが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"隠れて麺のところ潰してて(･_･;"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもね、なんかあみちゃんが隠れてやってるから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やめて！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってなんかわからんけど言えなくて‥"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/16/2504317/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから、まあやがヘアメイクして楽屋戻ってきたら またまた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみちゃんが...まあやのカバンからラーメン取り出して麺のところバキバキつぶしてて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すっごい悲しくなった夢を見たよ‥"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/16/2504317/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていう今日のブログは まあやの夢でした〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/16/250431